<template><div><h1 id="listingpage" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#listingpage"><span>ListingPage</span></a></h1>
<p>A high-level page component to render resource listings with DataTable, integrated searching, sorting, pagination sync with Inertia, header actions, bulk actions, custom filters, and optional tabs.</p>
<h2 id="features" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#features"><span>Features</span></a></h2>
<ul>
<li>🔎 Debounced search synced to URL via Inertia</li>
<li>↕️ Sorting with direction, preserved across navigation</li>
<li>📄 Pagination with proper 0-based/1-based conversion for Laravel</li>
<li>📏 Page size selector with URL sync</li>
<li>🧭 Header actions with permission-aware Create button</li>
<li>🧰 Extra DataTable buttons for export/delete selected</li>
<li>🧩 Pluggable columns and custom filters</li>
<li>🗂️ Optional tabs region</li>
<li>🌗 Dark mode-friendly classes</li>
</ul>
