</ul>
<h2 id="filtering-sorting-pagination" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#filtering-sorting-pagination"><span>Filtering, Sorting, Pagination</span></a></h2>
<ul>
<li>Debounced search (300ms) updates URL via <code v-pre>router.visit</code> only when values differ from server filters.</li>
<li>Sorting updates <code v-pre>sort_column</code> and <code v-pre>sort_direction</code> in URL/state.</li>
<li>Pagination converts 0-based index from DataTable to 1-based page for Laravel.</li>
<li>Page size updates are synced (<code v-pre>per_page</code>).</li>
</ul>
<p>These are all handled internally; pass the initial <code v-pre>filters</code> you receive from the server.</p>
